    {
      "additions": 24,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/ced86deb6186d0873f6855ec6b1c1d56f9bc3053/docs%2Fdocs%2Fadvanced_features%2Fserver_arguments.mdx",
      "changes": 24,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/contents/docs%2Fdocs%2Fadvanced_features%2Fserver_arguments.mdx?ref=ced86deb6186d0873f6855ec6b1c1d56f9bc3053",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/docs/advanced_features/server_arguments.mdx",
      "patch": "@@ -3104,6 +3104,12 @@ This option does not disable required attention or MoE collectives, including ex\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>The backend for disaggregation transfer. Default is mooncake.</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`mooncake`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}><code>mooncake</code>, <code>nixl</code>, <code>ascend</code>, <code>fake</code>, <code>mori</code>, <code>mooncake_tcp</code></td>\n+    </tr>\n+    <tr>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--disaggregation-enable-kv-checksum`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Compute an Adler-32 checksum over each request's KV pages on prefill and verify it on decode. Enable on both prefill and decode engines. A mismatch aborts the request, or raises in CI. With a decode-side radix cache the digest covers only the pages prefill sends. A prefill whose KV layout differs (TP width, PP stage, page size, dtype) is admitted unverified with one warning.</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`False`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>bool flag (set to enable)</td>\n     </tr>\n         <tr>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--disaggregation-bootstrap-port`</td>\n@@ -3129,18 +3135,36 @@ This option does not disable required attention or MoE collectives, including ex\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`False`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>bool flag (set to enable)</td>\n     </tr>\n+    <tr>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--disaggregation-decode-retraction-backup`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Storage backend for KV preserved across PD decode retraction. 'cpu_tensor' uses per-request CPU tensors. 'host_pool' uses a reserved HiCache pool and does not fall back on exhaustion. 'none' keeps no backup: a retracted request is aborted with 503 for the client to retry. If omitted, the backend is inferred from the decode KV pool.</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}><code>None</code></td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}><code>cpu_tensor</code>, <code>host_pool</code>, <code>none</code></td>\n+    </tr>\n     <tr>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--num-reserved-decode-tokens`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Number of decode tokens that will have memory reserved when adding new request to the running batch.</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`512`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Type: int</td>\n     </tr>\n+    <tr>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--disaggregation-decode-extra-slots`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Number of extra decode req_to_token slots pre-allocated for in-transfer requests (PD mode). If unset, defaults to 0 (or 2x the per-worker running batch for small batches).</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}><code>None</code></td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Type: int</td>\n+    </tr>\n     <tr>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--disaggregation-decode-polling-interval`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>The interval to poll requests in decode server. Can be set to &gt;1 to reduce the overhead of this.</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`1`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Type: int</td>\n     </tr>\n+    <tr>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--disaggregation-decode-host-receive-threshold`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Device token usage fraction at which incoming KV is received in the decode retraction host pool, excluding evictable cache pages. Range [0, 1]; 1 disables host receive (default), 0 always uses host receive. Size with --hicache-size or --hicache-ratio; requires dense NHD MHA buffers (including separate paged SWA pools) and a transfer backend that supports host destinations. No built-in backend currently supports this.</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`1.0`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Type: float</td>\n+    </tr>\n     <tr>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--disaggregation-decode-enable-radix-cache`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Enable radix cache on decode server (PD mode). Caches KV prefixes to avoid redundant transfers. Incompatible with --enable-hisparse, --disaggregation-transfer-backend fake, and speculative algorithms other than EAGLE, EAGLE3, and DSPARK.</td>",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/ced86deb6186d0873f6855ec6b1c1d56f9bc3053/docs%2Fdocs%2Fadvanced_features%2Fserver_arguments.mdx",
